	(text "NEW FOR THIS BOARD. Infineon SLB 9670 (the SLB 9672 was not found at LCSC), wired as the typical schematic in its\ndatasheet (vendor/lcsc_C539131): SPI, 100 nF at each VDD pin plus 1 uF, GPIO and PP left open.\nRuns from VCC_3V3_S0, the same supply as the processor's GPIO bank 3 it talks to.\nTPM reset follows the platform reset (RESET_L, 1.8 V) through a one-transistor level shifter, so software\ncannot reset the TPM on its own: this is what measured boot relies on.\nThe interrupt pin is open-drain with no internal pull-up, hence the 10K."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ec6547e-8173-5bb2-9912-2303b85ebb57")
	)
